<title>HONG KONG: Printing firm Cheong Ming seen in HK$80 mln IPO.</title>
<headline>Printing firm Cheong Ming seen in HK$80 mln IPO.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Printing concern Cheong Ming Holdings Ltd is expected to raise HK$80 million in an initial public offering (IPO) of shares in Hong Kong later in January, market sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>Sources said a listing presentation is expected to be held later this week, with dealing in the company's shares expected to start in late January.</p>
<p>Lippo Securities is expected to be the sponsor of the issue, they added.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available to the market, sources said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
